{"name":"Impulse","hex":"#005b87","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"impulse","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A thrust; a push; a sudden force that impels.","A wish or urge, particularly a sudden one prompting action."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To impel; to incite."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/impulse"}],"entries":[{"title":"Impulse (physics)","blocks":[{"text":"In classical mechanics, impulse is the change in momentum of an object. It is most often used to describe forces which act over short time periods, specifically in the case of impacts and collisions, for which it gets its namesake. Impulse is a vector quantity, meaning it has both a magnitude, which describes the amount by which the momentum changed, and a direction, which describes the direction in which the momentum changed."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Armedforces_jeffery_tee_shot.jpg/330px-Armedforces_jeffery_tee_shot.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Impulse_(physics)","wikidata":"Q837940"},{"title":"Impulse (TV series)","blocks":[{"text":"Impulse is an American science fiction drama television series based on the 2013 Steven Gould novel Impulse. The novel was one of a series following Gould's novel Jumper. The series is a stand-alone spin-off to the 2008 film adaptation of Jumper."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/1/1d/ImpulseTitleScreen.png/330px-ImpulseTitleScreen.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Impulse_(TV_series)","wikidata":"Q48816788"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Armedforces_jeffery_tee_shot.jpg/500px-Armedforces_jeffery_tee_shot.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Armedforces_jeffery_tee_shot.jpg/500px-Armedforces_jeffery_tee_shot.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AArmedforces_jeffery_tee_shot.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/1/1d/ImpulseTitleScreen.png/330px-ImpulseTitleScreen.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/1/1d/ImpulseTitleScreen.png/330px-ImpulseTitleScreen.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AImpulseTitleScreen.png"}],"sounds":{"impulse":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/En-us-impulse.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/39/En-us-impulse.ogg/En-us-impulse.ogg.mp3"}]}}}